Items for sale could be potions of water, potions of fruit juice and
candy bars, all of them slightly more expensive than shop prices. On
the other hand that provides an easy way to ID fruit juice, so maybe
just the other two items.
Each machine would have a finite number of goods inside. 

You can kick the machines for free stuff, but there would be certain
risks as illustrated above, and as with chests you might break fragile
items (potions) inside. You could also try to #force or pick the lock
to get the money out (Between 0 and 50 zorkmids + whatever you have
put in), but if you successfully force the lock you risk summoning the
Kops and if you open the lock magically you risk getting a gold golem.
Once the lock is broken, any remaining items in the vending machine
can only be accessed by kicking.
Town guards, obviously, would not tolerate any kind of vending machine
abuse.

